{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ed15aa08-056f-87bc-8b49-068f1883d264",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T11:13:39-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nicholas Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:10:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:10:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, and thank you for taking my call. I am calling about the trash and recycling pickup. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:10:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'm sorry, you're very quiet on my end. Could you say that again a little louder?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:10:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, of course, my apologies. I said I am calling about the trash and recycling pickup. Can you hear me better now? Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:10:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little better, yes. Trash and recycling. What do you need to know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:10:58-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I would like to ask for the new schedule after the holiday week. I understand there was a change, and I want to be certain which day to put the bins out. Thank you kindly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:11:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, which holiday week do you mean? I want to make sure I give you the right one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:11:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Pardon me, I am not sure I heard the whole question. The holiday week, the one that just went by, with the delay. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:11:29-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'm going to read you what I have, and you tell me if it matches. Your regular day was pushed back one day during the holiday week, and after that, collection goes back to your normal day. Do you know your regular day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:11:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is Thursday. Thank you for asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:11:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. Then you're back to Thursday as usual starting this week. Trash and recycling both go out Thursday, and recycling alternates weeks. Does that sound right to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:12:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that sounds right. Thank you. And one more question, if I may. My recycling bin has a cracked side and the lid is broken. How do I request a replacement? Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:12:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you faded out on me there. Did you say your recycling bin is cracked and you need a replacement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:12:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. The bin is cracked and the lid is broken. I would like a replacement. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:12:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Cracked bin, broken lid. You can request a replacement through our office. I'll take down your name and address and put in the request. Can I have those?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:12:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I would prefer not to give my address over the phone, if that is acceptable. Is there another way to request it? Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:12:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I can take your name and a callback number, and someone from the department can call you to confirm the details and arrange it. Would that work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:13:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that would be fine. My name is Nicholas Lombardozzi. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:13:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nicholas Lombardozzi. Can you spell the last name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:13:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. L, O, M, B, A, R, D, O, Z, Z, I. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:13:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "L-O-M-B-A-R-D-O-Z-Z-I. Got it. And the callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:13:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0165. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:13:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Reading it back: 401-555-0165. I've noted a cracked recycling bin with a broken lid, replacement requested, and Thursday pickup. Someone will call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:13:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. I appreciate your help. Good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:13:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Lombardozzi. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
